      "date": "2026-05-26",
      "description": "Decreased barrel count at all levels: Level 1-2: 5 -> 4 Number Level 3-4: 6 -> 5 Number Decreased troop levels at all levels: Level 1: Minion: 11 -> 10 Level Balloon: 10 -> 9 Level Baby Dragon: 9 -> 8 Level Level 2: Minion: 12 -> 11 Level Balloon: 11 -> 10 Level Baby Dragon: 10 -> 9 Level Level 3: Minion: 13 -> 12 Level Balloon: 12 -> 11 Level Baby Dragon: 11 -> 10 Level Level 4: Minion: 14 -> 13 Level Balloon: 13 -> 12 Level Baby Dragon: 12 -> 11 Level Decreased spawned Minions at all levels: Level 1: 3 -> 2 Summon Capacity Level 2: 4 -> 3 Summon Capacity Level 3-4: 5 -> 4 Summon Capacity"
    }
  ],
